    {
      "text": "OLMo 2 Instruct Safety scores are high (e.g. 93.3 for 7B) but fall across post-training stages from supervised fine-tuning (SFT) to reinforcement learning with verifiable rewards (RLVR) Instruct.", "tone": "mixed",
